# A profile deleted in the last session goes at the next launch, before Chromium starts, and its WebKit data with
# it (ProfileCleanup → WebKitStores.removeProfile). Nothing had started WebKit yet, and WebKit's reply crashed Cra
# at that launch (three crash reports, 0.1.42 to 0.1.44, in WebsiteDataStore::removeDataStoreWithIdentifierImpl).
seed deleted-profiles.json ["Profile 9"]
wait 3
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=after-cleanup
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
wait 2
